WEBVTT

00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:08.800
Mom! Dad!

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:10.280
Save me!

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:48.460
<b>Tsugaru Province</b>

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.300
<i>Father, watch over me.</i>

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.710
<i>I, Tsukishima Jinbei,</i>

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:53.850
<i>will succeed in my duties in Edo.</i>

00:02:14.410 --> 00:02:15.860
<i>I'm sure that in Edo,</i>

00:02:16.250 --> 00:02:17.860
<i>with the Insect Magistrate's Office,</i>

00:02:18.410 --> 00:02:21.450
<i>there are many strong people!</i>

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:26.660
<b>Edo</b>

00:02:33.700 --> 00:02:34.800
Mugai-sama...

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:43.810
More of them are out tonight.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:56.240
<i>I can't wait to see the kinds of 
strong warriors that are in Edo.</i>

00:02:57.680 --> 00:02:58.950
<i>Like my father!</i>

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:04.910
<b>Here comes 
Tsukishima Jinbei!</b>

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.140
So this is Edo?!

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:20.820
Good morning!

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.320
<i>Dear Father, in Tsugaru,</i>

00:03:31.320 --> 00:03:35.740
<i>Today I begin my new job at the 
Edo Insect Magistrate's Office.</i>

00:03:35.740 --> 00:03:40.040
<i>I'm still not sure what kind of place this is.</i>

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:43.840
<i>But as a warrior,</i>

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:48.300
<i>I am prepared to do my best, 
regardless of the conditions.</i>

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:50.080
<i>And I'm on my way there...</i>

00:03:50.650 --> 00:03:53.250
But I'm lost!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:57.240
<i>Father, when you're lost,</i>

00:03:57.240 --> 00:03:59.640
<i>the people of Edo are very unkind...</i>

00:04:00.040 --> 00:04:01.150
Excuse me...

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:01.840
Yes?

00:04:02.350 --> 00:04:04.130
Are you hurt?

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.140
Thank you so much!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:14.280
So sweet! So kind...

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:18.820
Allow me to introduce myself.

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:21.980
I'm Jinbei, and I've come here to work

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:23.790
at the Insect Magistrate's Office!

00:04:23.790 --> 00:04:25.510
My, the Insect Magistrate's?

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:26.070
Yes.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.330
My name is Haru.

00:04:29.630 --> 00:04:31.160
I work here, at this tea shop.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.550
<i>Wow!</i>

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:35.700
Is something wrong?

00:04:35.700 --> 00:04:37.370
No, nothing.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:40.340
Does your family

00:04:40.340 --> 00:04:42.030
run this place?

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:44.520
Yes, my grandfather and I.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:46.270
Just you two?

00:04:46.270 --> 00:04:47.430
What about your parents?

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:52.020
They died when I was young.

00:04:52.320 --> 00:04:54.180
I-I'm sorry...

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:55.180
Don't be.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.350
It's quite common here, in Edo.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:00.730
Common?

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:03.340
Oharu, the meat's done cooking!

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.370
Right!

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:09.990
Thanks for showing me the way, too.

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:12.510
It's fine.

00:05:12.510 --> 00:05:15.210
What made you decide to join 
the Insect Magistrate's Office?

00:05:18.140 --> 00:05:21.050
My father, in Tsugaru, was actually summoned.

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.050
However, my father

00:05:24.540 --> 00:05:26.050
cannot travel.

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:36.100
So I asked to fulfill my father's duties in his stead.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.960
How wonderful of you.

00:05:41.960 --> 00:05:42.980
Not at all.

00:05:44.390 --> 00:05:47.640
<i>You're even more wonderful!</i>

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:48.960
I'm very happy.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:53.320
Jinbei-sama, do you know how

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.750
the Insect Magistrate's Office came to be?

00:05:55.750 --> 00:06:01.090
<b>Suggestion Box</b>

00:05:57.500 --> 00:06:01.090
Ten years ago, in the 6th year of the Kyoho era,

00:06:01.090 --> 00:06:03.880
suggestion boxes were installed, 
as a way for commoners

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.910
to reach the government.

00:06:07.640 --> 00:06:10.560
Everyone in Edo wrote letters, 
asking for the creation

00:06:10.560 --> 00:06:12.130
of an Insect Magistrate's Office.

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:16.600
I wrote many, as well.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:24.300
To ask the government to 
protect us from the insects.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.910
So others wouldn't be attacked, 
as my parents were.

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.280
Oharu-dono...

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:31.240
What, exactly, are these "insects"?

00:06:35.040 --> 00:06:36.460
You stay here!

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.170
What's wrong?!

00:06:49.580 --> 00:06:51.930
Human skin?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:03.990
I-It looks like that monster from before.

00:07:04.540 --> 00:07:09.740
<b>Yarougumo - Prison Spider</b>

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:14.630
Stop it!

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:45.400
Wait.

00:07:47.230 --> 00:07:50.030
The Insect Magistrates are on their way.

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.490
Leave it to us.

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.700
Are you with the Insect Magistrates?

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:02.210
<b>Matsunohara Kotori</b>

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:59.530
I'm Matsunohara Kotori,

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:02.210
head of the Insect Magistrates.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.700
And you?

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.740
I am Tsukishima Jinbei.

00:08:06.740 --> 00:08:10.050
I've come to Edo to serve, in place of my father.

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:12.840
Genjuurou-dono's son?

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:18.220
I summoned the master swordsman of 
the Tsugaru Province, your father.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:22.520
My father

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:26.180
can no longer move...

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:30.120
He lost his left leg because of me.

00:08:34.550 --> 00:08:41.140
While traveling with the lord 
of the province's son,

00:08:42.260 --> 00:08:43.370
The bear...

00:08:43.730 --> 00:08:45.760
I encountered a monster like this one.

00:08:46.250 --> 00:08:49.250
But despite being the son of a samurai,

00:08:54.330 --> 00:08:57.430
I caused the lord's son to shame himself.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:58.770
<i>It can't be helped.</i>

00:08:58.100 --> 00:09:01.130
It was all my fault, but...

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:02.610
<i>I take full responsibility!</i>

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.530
Father took the blame.

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:07.150
<i>Father!</i>

00:09:09.530 --> 00:09:11.400
<i>Father!</i>

00:09:13.850 --> 00:09:15.920
It was my fault,

00:09:16.920 --> 00:09:19.900
but my father lost his leg, his position,

00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:21.910
and any chance at advancement.

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:27.120
So I want to at least be a strong 
samurai he can take pride in,

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:31.170
and perform his duties in his stead!

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:32.740
Please!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:37.320
I'm sorry, but fighting insects
 like the one you saw

00:09:37.320 --> 00:09:39.180
is the job of the Insect Magistrates.

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:42.080
Not just anyone can do it.

00:09:43.160 --> 00:09:44.420
Thank you!

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:44.980
Eh?

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.900
I'll prove to you that I'm not just anyone!

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:52.010
No, that isn't what I meant...

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:52.990
Trouble!

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:54.440
What's wrong?

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:57.240
It took one of the girls!

00:09:57.240 --> 00:09:58.820
Oharu-chan, from the tea stand!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.050
Oharu-dono?

00:10:01.050 --> 00:10:02.250
Where did it go?

00:10:02.250 --> 00:10:03.100
That way!

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:06.460
<i>Oharu-dono...</i>

00:10:07.660 --> 00:10:13.090
<i>So others wouldn't be attacked, 
as my parents were.</i>

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.010
<i>No!</i>

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.850
<i>It's quite common here, in Edo.</i>

00:10:35.610 --> 00:10:37.360
It's a Yarougumo.

00:10:37.690 --> 00:10:39.950
I hate s-spiders.

00:10:43.060 --> 00:10:44.370
Let's go.

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.200
No!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:05.220
No...

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:15.630
No!

00:11:23.440 --> 00:11:26.440
I'm sorry it took me so long to get here!

00:11:33.050 --> 00:11:34.340
Jinbei-sama!

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:39.580
<i>It's time.</i>

00:11:40.270 --> 00:11:42.090
<i>This is my first fight in Edo.</i>

00:11:44.270 --> 00:11:45.700
My name is Tsukishima Jinbei!

00:11:45.700 --> 00:11:46.850
Here I come!

00:11:51.380 --> 00:11:52.370
<i>Stay calm.</i>

00:11:54.330 --> 00:12:00.030
<i>Always be ready for a fight!</i>

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:00.030
<b>Always be ready for a fight.</b>

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:14.580
Those tricks won't work on me!

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.090
What?

00:12:44.210 --> 00:12:45.740
I didn't know there were so many!

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:54.500
Oh, no...

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:58.750
My katana's blade...

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:33.980
<i>Hydrangea Blossoms!</i>

00:13:41.180 --> 00:13:42.210
What?

00:13:42.700 --> 00:13:44.630
That is Hibachi-kun.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:48.930
The descendant of a ninja clan, 
and a whiz with gunpowder.

00:13:48.340 --> 00:13:49.890
<b>Hibachi</b>

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:53.070
Let's go, bugs!

00:13:53.070 --> 00:13:54.770
Koikawa Shungiku-kun.

00:13:55.310 --> 00:13:57.570
Known as the "Killer of 99"...

00:13:58.980 --> 00:13:59.810
<i>Repentance Slash!</i>

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.900
<b>Koikawa Shungiku</b>

00:14:00.560 --> 00:14:01.900
He is a criminal.

00:14:01.900 --> 00:14:03.760
I c-can do this...

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:08.190
Ichinotani Tenma-kun comes from 
a noble house of onmyodo.

00:14:08.190 --> 00:14:09.410
Matsukichi! Tamekichi!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.230
Do my bidding!

00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:13.490
He uses familiars known as shikigami.

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:16.250
Full speed ahead!

00:14:17.140 --> 00:14:20.130
<b>Ichinotani Tenma</b>

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:23.550
They are specialists at insect extermination.

00:14:23.550 --> 00:14:26.480
That is the power of the Insect Magistrates.

00:14:35.920 --> 00:14:37.540
How wonderful!

00:14:37.890 --> 00:14:39.610
You may step back.

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:40.610
I cannot.

00:14:40.610 --> 00:14:41.900
I am a samurai!

00:15:19.660 --> 00:15:20.810
Father!

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.750
Mother!

00:15:21.750 --> 00:15:23.030
Save me!

00:15:26.910 --> 00:15:30.150
<i>I can hear someone crying...</i>

00:15:31.870 --> 00:15:35.600
<i>Facing the enemy, a samurai 
must never be afraid.</i>

00:15:36.040 --> 00:15:37.340
<i>Listen, Jinbei.</i>

00:15:37.340 --> 00:15:38.140
<i>A samurai...</i>

00:15:38.140 --> 00:15:40.630
<i>It's my... It's my fault.</i>

00:15:41.070 --> 00:15:43.240
<i>I'm telling you what it means to be a samurai!</i>

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.750
<i>What will you grow up to be?</i>

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:52.380
<i>Someday, I want to be the best 
samurai in Japan, just like you!</i>

00:15:56.990 --> 00:15:58.570
<i>Listen to me, Jinbei...</i>

00:15:58.570 --> 00:16:03.770
<i>If we are frightened, the people 
behind us will be, as well.</i>

00:16:05.320 --> 00:16:07.110
<i>You must be a shining star</i>

00:16:07.870 --> 00:16:10.610
<i>that washes away fear...</i>

00:16:11.380 --> 00:16:15.400
<i>So that those behind you will not be afraid!</i>

00:16:19.030 --> 00:16:21.150
<i>You can do that, right, Jinbei?</i>

00:16:24.900 --> 00:16:28.300
<i>You're like me, a samurai who'll 
keep winning until he dies!</i>

00:16:35.420 --> 00:16:37.640
<i>Yes, Father!</i>

00:16:43.780 --> 00:16:45.060
<i>I failed...</i>

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:49.570
<i>I allowed Oharu-dono to be 
frightened in my presence.</i>

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:54.940
Please don't worry, Oharu-dono...

00:16:55.840 --> 00:17:01.940
I will not allow these monsters to touch you!

00:17:04.660 --> 00:17:07.080
I'll be stronger than anyone.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:10.760
Even stronger than my father!

00:17:21.020 --> 00:17:23.270
Keep winning until you die!

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:26.970
Always be ready for a fight!

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.420
Amazing.

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:41.920
I'd no idea he was so strong.

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:08.900
Jinbei-sama, run!

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:18.120
My strength...

00:18:50.950 --> 00:18:52.900
<i>I've found my star.</i>

00:19:02.460 --> 00:19:07.650
<i>Like the shining stars I saw in the 
night sky when I was young...</i>

00:19:19.350 --> 00:19:20.810
Thank you very much,

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:22.970
Jinbei-sama.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.520
I'd given up.

00:19:26.520 --> 00:19:30.140
I told myself that people in Edo
 die this way all the time.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:34.480
That I was going to die like my parents.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:37.790
Oharu-dono, you mustn't do that!

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:40.440
No one should have to die that way,

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:42.780
at the hands of a monster!

00:19:51.150 --> 00:19:52.790
<i>What are you asking for?</i>

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:57.210
<i>That someday, they'll protect us from the insects.</i>

00:19:57.910 --> 00:20:01.060
<i>Protect everyone in Edo. 
And you, too, Oharu.</i>

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:08.690
<i>Your prayer wasn't in vain, Mom and Dad...</i>

00:20:11.470 --> 00:20:15.900
Thank you for saving me!

00:20:17.030 --> 00:20:19.030
Please tell me your name.

00:20:20.370 --> 00:20:22.530
I am a samurai.

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:27.490
One day, my blade will repay the 
favor your blade has done for me!

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.430
I am not a full-grown warrior yet,

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:33.160
but I will become strong, like you...

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:37.100
A strong samurai who keeps 
winning until the day he dies!

00:20:37.100 --> 00:20:38.880
I am Tsukishima Jinbei...

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:47.640
You aren't worthy of speaking to Mugai-sama.

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:50.140
Jinbei-kun...

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.230
Aren't you coming

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:55.110
to the Insect Magistrate's Office?

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:56.890
Y-Yes!

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:02.650
<i>Tsukishima Jinbei...</i>

00:21:03.340 --> 00:21:09.220
<i>He might be a good find, Magistrate.</i>

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:09.660
<b>Tsukishima Jinbei</b>

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:17.670
<b>Shinnakamachi Magistrate's Office</b>

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.520
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:00.540 --> 00:23:01.490
What?

00:23:01.490 --> 00:23:03.350
Oharu-dono, bring those over here!

00:23:03.350 --> 00:23:04.410
What do you mean by "those"?

00:23:04.410 --> 00:23:07.950
The bombs hidden in your chest 
are about to explode!

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:09.200
Jinbei-sama, you pervert!

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:10.450
Hey!

00:23:10.570 --> 00:23:11.780
Next time, on <i>Mushibugyo</i>:

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.000
My rival is female ninja Hibachi!

00:23:11.780 --> 00:23:14.000
<b>My Rival Is Female Ninja Hibachi</b>
